5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"Hey everyone! I’m really excited to get this started. I just want to make sure whatever we pick actually works on the depot floor, not just in the office.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Kenji, the floor is critical, but I’m worried about the long-term financial bleed. We need to see the full lifecycle cost, not just the sticker price.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"I agree with Mizuki. But I’m more concerned about operational clarity. Who is actually accountable when the system fails? We need defined ownership, not just cost projections.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I think we should check if the new system will break like the old ones did! I want to see the upgrade history of the dispatch tool.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,I hear your worries. Let us look at the administrator retirements and hiring times. We must know who remains to guide us through this change.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, that dispatch tool history sounds super important! I’m also curious about the yard devices from the 2021 trial. Do they still work?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Kenji, the yard devices are a distraction. I need to trace the five years of renewal invoices to expose the hidden costs you’re ignoring.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Mizuki, invoices show past, not future risk. I need to know who owns support during outages. That defines accountability.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, I agree! If nobody owns the fix, it stays broken. I’ll check the support ownership during last winter’s outage.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Asuka, accountability is vital, yet it rests on people. I will examine the depot supervisors and the last rollout to see how they fared.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Mizuki, I get the cost worry, but if the yard gear fails, we lose money faster! I’m checking the yard devices and the depot calendar.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Kenji, hardware failure is a symptom, not the root cause. I will examine the five years of renewal invoices and the board minutes on capital requests.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, your support check is essential. I will examine the warehouse rule changes and the depot calendar to see how plans drift from reality.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
