19,1,3,talk,Servas,,"@Kenji, the calendar matters, but the people behind it matter more. I will look into the administrator retirements and the depot supervisors.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"@Servas, I totally agree! People are key. I’m checking the yard devices and the depot calendar to see if our gear can handle the peak season rush.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
