35,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"@Mizuki, this is bad! No freeze window in winter means we can’t stop. The 2021 trial failed fast. We need a system that survives peak season chaos.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"@Kenji, your urgency is noted, but the data is damning. Capital gets cut, yet operating costs pass unchecked. We are funding endless renewals, not solutions.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, my findings confirm the drift. Rules were rewritten twice, and the frozen scope failed. We are walking into the same operational chaos again.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, that sounds scary! But my findings are worse. We skipped upgrades for years, and the 2018 data lift was a total mess. We need a system that doesn’t age quietly!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, your findings echo my fears. Two key administrators leave, and supervisors ignore new routines. We must choose a vendor who invests in our people, not just software.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, skipping upgrades is terrifying! @Servas, if people ignore routines, the best software fails. We need a vendor who trains our depot crews properly.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Kenji, training is a line item, not a solution. The board ignores capital cuts but approves recurring fees. We are buying a subscription to failure, not a fix.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Mizuki, cost is a symptom. The root is structural: no freeze window, shifting rules. We need a vendor who enforces stability, not just cheap renewals.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Mizuki, I agree! If we just pay rent, the system rots. We need a vendor who fixes the mess, not just bills us for it!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Mizuki, the ledger is cold, but people are warm. We must ensure the vendor respects the human rhythm, not just the financial one.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Asuka, stability is key! But if the yard scanners are ancient, no software helps. We need hardware that actually works during the winter rush.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Kenji, hardware is a capital request, which the board has already rejected. You are asking for money that will never be approved.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Kenji, hardware is secondary. If the process is unstable, new scanners just fail faster. We need a vendor who guarantees process integrity, not just better tools.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Kenji, you’re right! Old scanners break. But if the software is messy, new scanners just get confused. We need both to work together!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,"@Kenji, hardware serves the hand, but the hand must know its purpose. We must ensure the vendor teaches our crews, not just installs their tools.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, exactly! We need a vendor who fixes the whole mess, not just the software. I’m ready to vote for whoever keeps our yards running!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,"@Kenji, I am ready. We must vote for the vendor whose contract structure prevents the recurring fees from becoming our permanent financial cage.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Mizuki, I am ready. I will vote for the vendor that enforces clear ownership and prevents scope drift. We cannot afford another year of chaos.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Rin,,I’m ready! I’ll vote for the vendor who stops the quiet aging and fixes the messy handoffs. No more broken stuff!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Servas,,"I am ready. I will vote for the vendor who sees our people as partners, not obstacles. Let us choose wisely.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
